{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019DZrQPaiR4CEqcuYwbErra","type":"tool_result","content":"Which brings us to the sentence this section exists for.\n\n> ⚓ **Worth Securing — the absent-component pattern.** An object can exist while nothing at all happens, if the component that would act on it is absent. The object is real; it's stored; `kubectl get` will show it to you. But an object is a *description*, and descriptions don't do anything by themselves. Something has to be watching for it and willing to act. Remember the phrase: **an object without its component does nothing.** You're going to meet it four more times in this book, and each time it will look like a completely different problem until you recognize it.\n\n*[cross-bearing: see Ch 9 — CoreDNS as the cluster DNS addon, and the Service DNS records it serves]*\n*[cross-bearing: see Ch 10 — an Ingress with no Ingress controller does nothing at all: the same pattern, first recurrence]*","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e9943108-f3f8-4b59-9fef-20ccf856db89","uuid":"fcabaaac-12ff-4858-831b-4d7a3bedbe57","timestamp":"2026-08-25T06:24:49.247Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"Which brings us to the sentence this section exists for.\n\n> ⚓ **Worth Securing — the absent-component pattern.** An object can exist while nothing at all happens, if the component that would act on it is absent. The object is real; it's stored; `kubectl get` will show it to you. But an object is a *description*, and descriptions don't do anything by themselves. Something has to be watching for it and willing to act. Remember the phrase: **an object without its component does nothing.** You're going to meet it four more times in this book, and each time it will look like a completely different problem until you recognize it.\n\n*[cross-bearing: see Ch 9 — CoreDNS as the cluster DNS addon, and the Service DNS records it serves]*\n*[cross-bearing: see Ch 10 — an Ingress with no Ingress controller does nothing at all: the same pattern, first recurrence]*","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
